  "solution": {
    "text": "Dividing the numerator and denominator by <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi></math> we get<br /><math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi></mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br />Hence, the fundamental period is&nbsp;<math><mi>‘</mi><mi>π</mi><mi>’</mi></math>",
